<h2 id="failures">Where Snowball, Mochi and Qwen fail</h2>
<p>The counts below cover every selected answer for these three models: 88 questions per condition.
Categories are mutually exclusive, applied in this order: correct, context/output exhaustion, scorer-detected refusal,
format error, then a parseable wrong answer. This avoids counting unfinished reasoning again as a format error.
“Refusal” here includes declaring that the supplied information is insufficient; it is not necessarily a safety refusal.
The frozen phrase-based detector is imperfect, so some semantic refusals appear under format errors.</p>
